{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Dil aisa kisi [C#]ne mera toda
[D#]Barbadi ki taraf aisa moda
[D#]Ek bhale manus ko
[D#]Amanush bana [C#]ke chhoda
[D#]Sagar kitna [C#]mere paas hai
[G#]Mere jeevan mein [D#]phir bhi pyas hai
[D#]Hai pyas badi, [C#]jeevan thoda
[C#]Amanush bana [D#]ke chhoda
[D#]Kehte hain [C#]duniya ke raaste
[G#]Koyi manzil [D#]nahin tere waaste
[D#]Nakamiyon se [C#]naata mera joda
[C#]Amanush bana [D#]ke chhoda
[D#]Dhooba sooraj [C#]phir se nikle
[G#]Rehta nahin [D#]hai andera
